  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Glendale, WI\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Glendale, WI\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nGlendale, WI\nEmergency and Specialty\n414.540.6710\n2100 W Silver Spring Dr\nGlendale, WI 53209\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nMon-Wed: 24 hours\nThu: 8 am-8 pm\nFri: 10 am-8 pm\nSat & Sun: 8 am-8 pm\nSpecialty:\nMon & Wed: 7 am-7 pm\nTue & Thu: 8 am-7 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Glendale - serving greater Milwaukee and beyond.\nWith locations in Glendale, Oak Creek and Port Washington, BluePearl Pet Hospital – formerly known as Lakeshore Veterinary Specialists – provides specialty pet care throughout southeast Wisconsin, northern Milwaukee and northern Illinois.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nOur experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency medicine\nOur highly trained emergency doctors are equipped to handle all your emergency care needs.\nSpecialty care\nOur specialists have the knowledge and advanced training necessary to handle even the most complex cases.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nCore values.\nAt BluePearl, we have devoted ourselves to delivering the highest quality advanced medicine with a team of board-certified veterinary specialists and residency-trained veterinarians. Add in a group of exceptionally devoted and experienced technicians and client care specialists, and you’ve got a recipe for extraordinary care.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n414.540.6710\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n414.540.6710\n2100 W Silver Spring Dr\nGlendale,\nWI                                    53209\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nOak Creek, WI\n9472 S 27th St\nOak Creek, WI 53154\n414.761.6333\n17.00 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nPort Washington, WI\n207 W Seven Hills Rd\nPort Washington, WI 53074\n262.268.7800\n20.32 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nNorthfield, IL\n820 W Frontage Rd\nNorthfield, IL 60093\n847.564.5775\n69.97 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
